# Boundaries

- Packages must not import `apps/*`.
- No cross-app source imports between `apps/web` and `apps/agent`.
- `@warden` graph: `web → api|shared|ui`, `api → db|shared`; no cycles.
- Only `packages/db` constructs `PrismaClient`. Web uses DB via `@warden/api`.
- `packages/ui` is `cn()` only — no domain/tRPC/Prisma/auth.
- Keep `Warden.Core` / `Warden.LockUI` inside `apps/agent`.
- After structural edits run `npm run check:boundaries`.
